    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058560/extras/aaaecf0c183a54320029fe2d4123702d.avif?t=1737777272\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br><br>Batik Heroes is a dungeon-crawler roguelike card battler game. <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introducing the Characters</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058560/extras/cb00ea1858d4d91e5066455905ded4b7.avif?t=1737777272\" width=729 height=430 /></span><br>You can choose to play as a male or female warrior, venturing into a mysterious dungeon filled with peril and secrets. Your progress depends on defeating enemies and strategically building yourcard deck to survive the various challenges. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058560/extras/d8b2124dd42fd8afac8ff0141321816c.avif?t=1737777272\" width=729 height=430 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2></strong><br>You can enhance your weapons, master your skills, and unlock new, powerful cards as you advance. Careful planning and tactical execution are crucial to overcoming the dungeon's threats and emerging victorious.",
